WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.870
Broccoli, kale, cauliflower,
Brussels sprouts.

2
00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:05.760
They look nothing alike.

3
00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:08.890
Yet all of them were
bred from one wild plant,

4
00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:12.240
wild cabbage, in a few thousand years.

5
00:00:12.290 --> 00:00:16.080
But most of life's history happened
with no one there to watch.

6
00:00:16.130 --> 00:00:20.530
So how can we trust the evidence that
living things have changed over time?

7
00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:24.880
In this mission, you'll find out where
the evidence of change comes from.

8
00:00:24.930 --> 00:00:30.150
Then you'll see how other scientists check
a new claim before anyone accepts it.

9
00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:35.320
Your mission: find out why we can trust the
evidence that living things have changed.
